<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/30/msa@/~part_II__cl_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/30/msa@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/30/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/30/msa@/~part_II__cl_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/30/msa@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/30/msa@> .
